OL,3,GNEWSA'Wildly unfair that my husband and
OL,4,AI pay #4k a year for ADHD treatment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdults with Attention Deficit
OL,7,FHyperactivity Disorder (ADHD) are
OL,8,Fdemanding urgent action over a lack of
OL,9,Ffunded services in Northern Ireland,
OL,10,Fwith some revealing they pay thousands
OL,11,Fof pounds a year for private treatment.
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland doesn't have a
OL,14,Fformally commissioned, publicly funded
OL,15,Fadult ADHD pathway like in other parts
OL,16,Fof the UK.
OL,18,FOne woman has described the situation
OL,19,Fas "wildly unfair and inhumane", saying
OL,20,Fshe and her husband spend about #4,000
OL,21,Fa year on private treatment and care.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
