OL,3,GNEWSA'Wildly unfair that my husband and
OL,4,AI pay #4k a year for ADHD treatment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health acknowledges
OL,7,Fincreasing demand but said decisions
OL,8,Fmust be taken in the context of overall
OL,9,Faffordability.
